# TOS boot text — Stage 1

This is the canonical boot text of the Stage 1 capsule. It is **illustrative**:
TOS Core is not a language yet (see ADR-0015; a parser is gated at Stage 1.5).
The lines below are read by the nucleus only to verify that the canonical boot
file resolves and to expose its first logical line over serial.

# TOS boot text
print("hello from tos stage 1")